ater copied by Cyril in his &lt;i&gt;Apologia&lt;/i&gt;. The discovery of this 'self-plagiarism' has considerable implications for dating the &lt;i&gt;Apologia &lt;/i&gt;as discussed at the end of the article.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
